al.png)\n![Timely Dispute Resolution](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/Question.svg)\n![Quality Assurance](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/SealCheck.svg)\n![Buyer Protection](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/ShieldCheck.svg)\n![Transparency & Tracking](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/FileMagnifyingGlass.svg)\n\n## HM Central Park - Neighbourhood\n\n![](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/CTAbg.webp)\n\n### Looking for your dream home?\n\n![svg](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/house.svg)\n![svg](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/lightbulb-filament.svg)\n![svg](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/ListChecks.svg)\n![arrow](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/rightArrowWhite.svg)\n\n## Compare Projects\n\n## Price Trend for HM Central Park\n\n![connect_img](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/connectPropertyImg.webp)\n\n## Top Developers in Mumbai\n\n## Builders\n\nNo builders found\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions\n\n### Where is HM Central Park located?\n\n### What is the available Apartment size in HM Central Park?\n\n### What is the RERA Number of HM Central Park of Tardeo?\n\n### What is the price range of HM Central Park of Tardeo?\n\n### Where to download the HM Central Park brochure?\n\n### Where to download the HM Central Park floor plan?\n\n### What is the nearest landmark to HM Central Park residential project?\n\n### What amenities are available at HM Central Park residential project?\n\n### Does HM Central Park residential project have covered car parking?\n\n### Which banks can approve loans for HM Central Park residential project?\n\n### Is a transportation facility easily available near HM Central Park residential project?\n\n![chat](https://assets.nobroker.in/nb-new/public/Common/chatLightBg.svg)\n\n## Sale Properties in HM Central Park\n\nRequest Floor Plan\n\n![arrow](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-merchandise/arrow-right_nbReact2weapo.svg)\n\nRequest Floor Plan\n\n![arrow](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-merchandise/arrow-right_nbReact2weapo.svg)\n\nRequest Floor Plan\n\n![arrow](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-merchandise/arrow-right_nbReact2weapo.svg)\n\nRequest Floor Plan\n\n![arrow](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-merchandise/arrow-right_nbReact2weapo.svg)\n\n## About the Builder\n\n### HM Holdings\n\nHM Holdings has been been one of the most premium real estate developer in India since its inception. It has firmly established itself as one of the leading and successful developers of real estate in India by imprinting its mark across all the classes. With years of market experience and a rich bag of clients, it has provided its customers a rich living experience with the best housing infrastructure.\n\n## HM Central Park - Neighbourhood\n\n![nearby-dummy-map](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-merchandise/mumbai_staticmap.webp)\n\n## Similar Projects\n\n## More Projects in the Tardeo Area\n\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![WhatsApp](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-common/WhatsAppIcon.svg)\n![](https://assets.nobroker.in/nob-merchandise/caret-right-bold.svg)","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.nobrokerage.com/project/details/lodha-malabar-walkeshwar-malabar-hill-mumbai-689041","title":"Lodha Malabar, Malabar hill, Mumbai | NoBrokerage.com","raw_content":"![Loading...](/Loader.webp)\n\n* [![Home](/icons/home_quick_link.svg)Home](/)\n* [![Search](/icons/search_quick_link.svg)Search](/search)\n* [![Property](/icons/Add_quick_link.svg)Property](/form/postproperty)\n* [![Profile](/icons/profile_quick_link.svg)Profile](/dashboard)\n\n![Lodha Malabar banner](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/1765372822918-45685fd1412a62fe.jpg)\n\n![Developer Logo 1](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/project/builder-logos/lodha-malabar/builderlogos-lodha-logo-png-0763d9.png)\n\nPalaces by the sea\n\n![Project Icon](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/1765372822917-a73460d34ece82cd.png)\n\n## 4 & 5 BHK Homes\n\nStarting from₹ 65.05 Cr\n\nMalabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n![Lodha Malabar mobile banner](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/1765372822916-c87644182ca1d883.jpg)\n\n![Developer Logo 1](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/project/builder-logos/lodha-malabar/builderlogos-lodha-logo-png-0763d9.png)\n\nPalaces by the sea\n\n![Project details background](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/1765372822915-5bd0286e4a60a29d.jpg)\n\n![Project Icon](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/1765372822917-a73460d34ece82cd.png)\n\nPresenting\n\n## 4 & 5 BHK Homes\n\nStarting from₹ 65.05 Cr\n\nMalabar Hill, Mumbai\n\nLast Updated : 04 Sept, 2026\n\nLodha Malabar\n\nBROKERAGE FREE\n\n[By Lodha Developers Limited](/builder/lodha \"Open Lodha Developers Limited page\")\n\nMalabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n₹ 65.05 – 112.88 Cr+ Charges\n\nEMI starts at ₹ 56.45 Lac / M\n\nUnder Construction\n\nCompletion In 28 Jun 2027 Onwards\n\nLodha Malabar offers exclusive \"Palaces by the sea\" on Walkeshwar Road, an elite South Mumbai location. The project uniquely borders the Arabian Sea and the Hanging Gardens. Residents benefit from Club Saint Amand, a private members' club, and a life orchestrated by the luxury hospitality experts, Saint Amand. It offers large format 4 & 5 BHK, Duplex, and Penthouse options. The MahaRERA registration number is P51900034949.\n\n## ProjectDetails\n\n![Project Type](/projectOverview/icons/project-type.svg)\n\n#### Project Type\n\nResidential\n\n![Status](/projectOverview/icons/status.svg)\n\n#### Status\n\nUnder Construction\n\n![Project Area](/projectOverview/icons/project-area.svg)\n\n#### Project Area\n\n4390.96 SQM\n\n![Towers](/projectOverview/icons/tower.svg)\n\n#### Towers\n\n1\n\n![Configurations](/projectOverview/icons/configuration.svg)\n\n#### Configurations\n\n4 & 5 BHK Apartments\n\n![Total Floors](/projectOverview/icons/total-units.svg)\n\n#### Total Floors\n\n36\n\n![Amenities](/projectOverview/icons/amenities.svg)\n\n#### Amenities\n\n33 Amenities\n\n![Parking](/projectOverview/icons/parking.svg)\n\n#### Parking\n\nAvailable\n\n![Locality](/projectOverview/icons/locality.svg)\n\n#### Locality\n\nMalabar Hill\n\n![Pin code](/projectOverview/icons/pincode.svg)\n\n#### Pin Code\n\n400006\n\n![Landmark](/projectOverview/icons/landmark.svg)\n\n#### Landmark\n\nMalabar Hill\n\n![Address](/projectOverview/icons/address.svg)\n\n#### Address\n\nLodha Malabar, Krishanaraj Society, Sea Face, Walkeshwar, Malabar Hill, Mumbai, Maharashtra\n\n## Configurations\n\n4 BHK3,826 - 4036.79 sq.ft\n\n₹ 65.05 – 68.63 Crore\n\n5 BHK6,271 - 6640.25 sq.ft\n\n₹ 106.61 – 112.88 Crore\n\n![background pattern](/icons/BgPattern.svg)\n\nMumbai\n\n## Want to Schedule a Site Visit?\n\nExplore the property in person at your convenience.\n\n![schedule illustration](/icons/Illustration.svg)\n\n## FloorPlans\n\n4 BHK₹ 65.05 Cr\n\n3826 sq.ftCarpet Area\n\n![4 BHK floor plan](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/floor-plans/4bhk.jpeg)\n\nPossession  \nin Aug 2028\n\n### 4 BHK\n\n₹ 65.05 Cr\n\n3826sq.ft\n\nCarpet Area\n\n![₹ 65.05 Cr](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/floor-plans/4bhk.jpeg)\n\nPossession  \nin Aug 2028\n\n4 BHK₹ 68.63 Cr\n\n4036.79 sq.ftCarpet Area\n\n![4 BHK floor plan](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/floor-plans/4bhk.jpeg)\n\nPossession  \nin Aug 2028\n\n### 4 BHK\n\n₹ 68.63 Cr\n\n4036.79sq.ft\n\nCarpet Area\n\n![₹ 68.63 Cr](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/floor-plans/4bhk.jpeg)\n\nPossession  \nin Aug 2028\n\n## AboutProject\n\nLodha Malabar is a collection of exclusive \"Palaces by the sea\" located in South Mumbai's finest location, on the iconic Walkeshwar Road. The project commands an unmatched address, positioned directly opposite the Governor's estate and touching both the Arabian Sea and the historic Hanging Gardens. This prime positioning places the world literally at the residents' feet. A central feature of the development is Club Saint Amand, a private member's club meticulously conceived around active, social, and leisure lifestyles of its privileged residents. The living experience is orchestrated for seamless comfort and luxury, managed by the discreet and expert touch of the luxury hospitality service, Saint Amand. This service ensures that residents receive world-class attention and a perfectly choreographed life. Lodha Malabar offers Duplex/Pent House/4 & 5 BHK residences. The project is officially registered via the MahaRERA registration number P51900034949.\n\n## Amenities\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/06/18/IMAGE/fire-safety-system-copy-332581.png)\n\nFire Safety System\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/06/30/IMAGE/security-guardspng1-f1b764.png)\n\nSecurity\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/06/18/IMAGE/club-house-a73a39.png)\n\nClubhouse\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/security-guards.svg)\n\nSecurity Guards\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/24-7-water-supply.svg)\n\n24 7 Water Supply\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/24x7-security.svg)\n\n24x7 Security\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/cctv-surveillance.svg)\n\nCctv Surveillance\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/06/18/IMAGE/dg-backup-fe3944.png)\n\nDg Backup\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/lounge-area.svg)\n\nLounge Area\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/deck.svg)\n\nDeck\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/06/18/IMAGE/cab-pickup-and-drop-off-point-3abc78.png)\n\nCab Pickup And Dropoff Point\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/balcony.svg)\n\nBalcony\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/designer-bathroom-tiles.svg)\n\nDesigner Bathroom Tiles\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/glass-partitions-in-bathrooms.svg)\n\nGlass Partitions In Bathrooms\n\n## ProjectGallery\n\n## Brochure\n\n![Brochure Page 1](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/brochures/cmid2hdbv00hasa6x3c2vhj6a/v1/page_1_full.webp)\n\n1of2\n\n## AboutLocation\n\nMalabar Hill is one of Mumbai’s most prestigious and luxurious residential areas, known for sea-view living and exclusive neighbourhood standards. It features high-end apartments, iconic mansions, and secure, private surroundings. With limited inventory and elite demand, property values here continually rise over time. The locality blends tranquillity with proximity to major South Mumbai business areas, making it a prized lifestyle and investment destination.\n\n## Maps\n\nInitializing Map...\n\n![Verified](/icons/green-check.svg)RERA Verified Project\n\n### What is RERA ?\n\nRERA (Real Estate Regulatory Authority) is a government regulatory body established under the Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 in India.\n\nIts primary purpose is to regulate the real estate sector, increase transparency, and protect home buyers from fraud, project delays, and unfair practices.\n\n![RERA Approved](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/rera.png)\n\n![RERA QR Code](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/1765372822917-b56438044a26f42e.jpg)\n\nRERA ID\n\nP51900034949\n\n## AboutDeveloper\n\n[![Lodha](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/05/14/IMAGE/lodha-logo-jpg-a3a8a1.jpg)](/builder/lodha \"Lodha\")\n\nLodha![Check](/icons/green-check.svg)\n\nYears of Experience –46 years\n\nLodha Group, operating under Macrotech Developers, is unequivocally one of India's foremost and largest real estate companies, established with a vision for creating world-class residential and commercial landmarks since 1980. Their developer features include a significant emphasis on scale and timely delivery, having successfully completed millions of square feet of development across Mumbai, Pune, and other metropolitan areas. The company's hallmark is its commitment to high-quality construction and an uncompromised customer-centric approach, which has cemented their reputation for building highly desirable properties. Being listed on the BSE and NSE, the group adheres to stringent corporate governance and financial transparency. Lodha specializes in creating large-scale estates that offer holistic living experiences, integrating advanced security, modern infrastructure, and exclusive lifestyle amenities.\n\n80ProjectsCompleted\n\n30OngoingProjects\n\n4In CityProjects\n\n## Disclaimer\n\nNoBrokerage.com is a real estate advertising and information platform. We are not a real estate broker, agent, or channel partner, and we do not facilitate or participate in any property transactions.\n\nThe data displayed on this website is based on inputs from developers, owners, or public sources, and is provided for informational purposes only. While we aim for accuracy, we do not verify the data and make no guarantees regarding its completeness or correctness.\n\nNo information on this website constitutes legal, financial, or investment advice, nor should it be treated as an invitation to purchase or acquire any property. Project listings do not imply RERA registration or regulatory compliance. Users are advised to verify all information independently and consult the relevant RERA authority. All third-party names, images, logos, and trademarks belong to their respective owners.\n\nFor feedback or concerns, email: [support@nobrokerage.com](mailto:support@nobrokerage.com)\n\nLoading reviews...\n\n# Frequently Asked\n\nQuestions\n\nGet answers to the most common questions about Lodha Malabar in West 